  "title": "Pan Fried Halibut",
  "description": "This pan-fried halibut recipe is spiced with herbes de Provence and seafood seasoning, such as Old Bay, before pan-frying for a quick and easy dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "ellenmoriah"
  ],
